d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2})=v\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x},\n$$\n\nwe can write our differential equation $(∗)$ as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2})=-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+3}.\n$$" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314075 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314076 13194139534843 true] [17592186314075 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314077 13194139534843 true] [17592186314075 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314078 13194139534843 true] [17592186314075 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314079 13194139534843 true] [17592186314075 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314080 13194139534843 true] [17592186314075 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534843 true] [17592186314075 1041 "selection" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314075 1104 #edb/ref 17592186314079 13194139534843 true] [17592186314075 1110 #uuid "4ca2bad5-eebc-557a-a58f-638f93fcb85c" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314076 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{v}^{2})=-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+3}" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314076 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534843 true] [17592186314076 1111 #uuid "30dda7a5-4016-5e40-9224-3c6279cdd41c" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314077 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+3}" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314077 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534843 true] [17592186314077 1111 #uuid "db3b5ecf-1216-57f7-94c9-70c9b7c34f97" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314078 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+3}" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314078 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534843 true] [17592186314078 1111 #uuid "7c730bf0-872c-5722-bdec-13ef6599263d" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314079 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2})=-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+3}" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314079 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534843 true] [17592186314079 1111 #uuid "2096a1f6-beb6-516f-98b7-c133fda87158" 13194139534843 true] [17592186314080 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2})=\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+3}" 13194139534843 true] [1